241	/**
242	 * Reveal the current Nextcloud admin password to the OWNER (or an admin who is NOT
243	 * impersonating). Same discipline as the SFTP-password reveal in
244	 * lib/actions-hosting.ts — an impersonating admin must never exfiltrate it.
